  "totalBlocks": 53,
  "translatedBlocks": 49,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b82ad5458de1c026",
      "translationZh": "数据集的使用量一直在爆炸式增长，Hugging Face 已成为许多数据集的默认托管平台。每个月，随着上传到 Hub 的数据集数量增加，查询、筛选和发现这些数据集的需求也随之增长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "435f520000980917",
      "translationZh": "每月在 Hugging Face Hub 上创建的数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3b2ae8fcf835c42",
      "translationZh": "我们非常兴奋地宣布，现在你可以直接在 Hugging Face Hub 中对自己的数据集运行 SQL 查询了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "77042ca8a0291f1d",
      "translationZh": "数据集 SQL Console 正式推出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f43bc2edc2652261",
      "translationZh": "你应该能在每个数据集上看到一个新的 SQL Console 徽章。只需点击一下，即可打开 SQL Console 来查询该数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "057c2f874be0eab8",
      "translationZh": "查询 Magpie-Ultra 数据集，查找出色、高质量的推理指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23c56aa39dc84760",
      "translationZh": "所有操作都在浏览器中完成，而且该控制台还具备一些实用的功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9d647289b65767a",
      "translationZh": "100% 本地运行：SQL Console 由 DuckDB WASM 驱动，因此你无需任何依赖项即可查询数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "049f799876c64ee0",
      "translationZh": "完整的 DuckDB 语法：DuckDB 完整支持 SQL 语法，还提供了许多用于正则表达式、列表、JSON、嵌入等的内置函数。你会发现 DuckDB 的语法与 PostgreSQL 非常相似。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a37e2107e5b9cc90",
      "translationZh": "导出结果：你可以将查询结果导出为 parquet。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55ba730bb6b2a85b",
      "translationZh": "可分享：你可以通过链接分享对公开数据集的查询结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "21ff8e6d9bf750eb",
      "translationZh": "Parquet 转换",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9defa9cacfc1f9eb",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 上的大多数数据集都以 Parquet 格式存储，这是一种针对性能和存储效率进行优化的列式数据格式。Hugging Face 上的 Dataset Viewer 和 SQL Console 直接从数据集的 Parquet 文件中加载数据。如果数据集采用其他格式，则前 5GB 数据会自动转换为 Parquet。你可以在 Dataset Viewer Parquet API 文档中找到有关 Parquet 转换过程的更多信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de78c3f4529de54f",
      "translationZh": "SQL Console 使用这些 Parquet 文件，根据数据集的划分和配置创建视图，供你查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123c5ddfc23d47d7",
      "translationZh": "DuckDB WASM 是驱动 SQL Console 的引擎。它是一个进程内数据库引擎，通过 Web Assembly 在浏览器中运行，无需服务器或后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e234774750dc494b",
      "translationZh": "由于完全在浏览器中运行，它让用户能够以极大的灵活性随心所欲地查询数据，无需任何依赖。只需一个简单的链接，就能轻松分享可复现的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd2587523449c2c0",
      "translationZh": "你可能会问：“它能处理大型数据集吗？”答案是：“能！”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2eee9ea100363688",
      "translationZh": "下面是对 OpenCo7/UpVoteWeb 数据集的一次查询，该数据集转换为 Parquet 格式后包含 12.6M 行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3501b8d92770bf8f",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，我们在不到 3 秒的时间内就得到了一个简单筛选查询的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec9c5bb58da7b0d5",
      "translationZh": "虽然数据集越大、查询越复杂，查询耗时就会越长，但 SQL Console 能完成的事情之多，会让你感到惊讶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40f1757010e0d582",
      "translationZh": "和任何技术一样，它也有局限性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "979d2147fe222985",
      "translationZh": "SQL Console 能够处理很多查询。不过，内存上限约为 3GB，因此可能会出现内存耗尽、无法处理查询的情况（提示：尝试使用筛选条件并配合 LIMIT，减少查询的数据量）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f551f33dde332383",
      "translationZh": "虽然 DuckDB WASM 非常强大，但它的功能还未与 DuckDB 完全对等。例如，DuckDB WASM 尚不支持通过 hf:// 协议查询数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e2a4076183a08dbf",
      "translationZh": "示例：将数据集从 Alpaca 格式转换为对话格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbd7e1024b18ba9b",
      "translationZh": "既然我们已经介绍了 SQL Console，接下来就来看一个实际示例。在微调大语言模型（LLM）时，你通常需要处理不同的数据格式。其中一种特别流行的格式是对话格式，每一行都表示用户与模型之间的一段多轮对话。SQL Console 可以帮助我们高效地将数据转换为这种格式。下面来看看如何使用 SQL 将 Alpaca 数据集转换为对话格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b96a1e56ba79567a",
      "translationZh": "通常，开发者会通过 Python 预处理步骤来完成这项任务，但我们可以演示如何使用 SQL Console 在不到 30 秒的时间内达到同样的效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26b517475ab60b5a",
      "translationZh": "在上方的数据集中，点击 SQL Console 徽标以打开 SQL Console。你应该会看到下面的查询已自动填入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d861596900c855d",
      "translationZh": "准备好后，点击 Run Query 按钮执行查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e8f7aef4a60465f",
      "translationZh": "在查询中，我们使用 struct_pack 函数为每段对话创建一个新的 STRUCT 行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23c7971f98099d4f",
      "translationZh": "DuckDB 提供了关于 STRUCT 数据类型及其函数的出色文档。你会发现，许多数据集都包含存储 JSON 数据的列。DuckDB 提供了一些函数，可以轻松解析和查询这些列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17a03f02af93e218",
      "translationZh": "获得结果后，我们可以将其下载为 Parquet 文件。你可以在下方查看最终输出的样子。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d35e7d023edb5535",
      "translationZh": "试试看！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adc63e08b7ce5298",
      "translationZh": "再举一个例子，你可以尝试使用 SQL Console 查询 SkunkworksAI/reasoning-0.01，查看包含超过 10 个推理步骤的指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e0ecf3e11d09c3b5",
      "translationZh": "SQL 片段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4885a0242abbbfc7",
      "translationZh": "DuckDB 有大量用例，我们仍在不断探索。我们创建了一个 SQL Snippets 空间，用来展示你可以使用 SQL Console 做些什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cd8676f1822400f",
      "translationZh": "以下是我们发现的一些非常有趣的用例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad908a7869ec3c65",
      "translationZh": "使用正则表达式筛选函数调用数据集中涉及特定函数的数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5014f62c70a47273",
      "translationZh": "从 open-llm-leaderboard 中找出最受欢迎的基础模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f68106c898ad18d",
      "translationZh": "将 alpaca 数据集转换为对话格式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bac31c812919e35",
      "translationZh": "使用嵌入向量进行相似性搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95c59a1e9f8bbc76",
      "translationZh": "从数据集的 50k+ 行中筛选出质量最高的推理指令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34b551be0e94de6c",
      "translationZh": "别忘了，只需单击一下，即可将 SQL 查询结果下载为 Parquet 文件，用于你的数据集！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "331277757e3e4cb0",
      "translationZh": "我们很想听听你对 SQL Console 的看法。如果你有任何反馈，请在这篇文章下留言！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2055cf99ca27faf",
      "translationZh": "DuckDB 语法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e518ab8649cceff1",
      "translationZh": "DuckDB WASM 论文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
